flowchart LR
  Change[Code / Config Change] --> MR[GitLab Merge Request]
  MR --> Secret[Secret Scan]
  Secret --> Lint[ShellCheck / Syntax]
  Lint --> Tests[BATS Tests]
  Tests --> Gate[Architecture Impact Gate]
  Gate --> Mermaid[Mermaid Source Update]
  Mermaid --> Render[Beautiful Mermaid Renderer]
  Render --> SVG[Generated SVG Artifacts]
  SVG --> MkDocs[MkDocs Strict Build]
  MkDocs --> Pages[GitLab Pages Documentation]
  Gate -->|No architecture impact| Decision[architecture-no-change.md]
  Decision --> MkDocs
